        <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="co" id="co"></a>This clause establishes the <b>Co</b> Requirements class, with IRI <tt>/req/co</tt>, which has a corresponding Conformance Class, <b>Co</b>, with IRI <tt>/conf/co</tt>.</p>
