rs:GalacticCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:HorizontalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:PerifocalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:SuperGalacticCS</a> to be used in SPARQL graph patterns.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>

