/a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:CurvilinearCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:EngineeringCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:GeodeticCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:GeographicalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:GridCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:HexagonalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:LinearCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:LocalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:ObliqueCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:OrdinalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:OrthogonalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:ParametricCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:PlanarCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:PolarCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:VerticalCoordinateSystem</a> to be used in SPARQL graph patterns.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>

