        <div><a name="_2c36e398-a39c-b131-fa3f-3b8f3c298c35" id="_2c36e398-a39c-b131-fa3f-3b8f3c298c35"></a><h2>8.6.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Temporal Coordinate Systems</h2>

<div class="require"><a name="_5453b826-ee5d-4ffd-978e-31eab4fb8ec5" id="_5453b826-ee5d-4ffd-978e-31eab4fb8ec5"></a><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" width="100%"><a name="_req_cs_Temporal_Coordinate_Systems" id="_req_cs_Temporal_Coordinate_Systems"></a><thead><tr><th colspan="2" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p class="RecommendationTitle" style="page-break-after:avoid">Requirement 13: Temporal Coordinate Systems</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Identifier</th><td style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><tt>/req/cs/Temporal_Coordinate_Systems</tt></td></tr><tr><th style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">Statement</th><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_20785b3b-831e-8e0e-fdf5-7611905d8df8" id="_20785b3b-831e-8e0e-fdf5-7611905d8df8"></a>Implementations shall allow the RDFS classes <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:1DCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:DateTimeTemporalCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geosrs:TemporalCountCoordinateSystem</a>, <a href="#Class__geosrs">geo