<div><a name="_e2b80b6f-8836-ae69-aa63-e139b78e6f51" id="_e2b80b6f-8836-ae69-aa63-e139b78e6f51"></a><h3>8.6.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Class: geosrs:1DCoordinateSystem</h3>

