<div><a name="_a583a707-100f-e7fa-6a6f-f903a884c47f" id="_a583a707-100f-e7fa-6a6f-f903a884c47f"></a><h3>10.2.5.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Class: geosrs:SatelliteNavigation</h3>

