        <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="planet" id="planet"></a>This clause establishes the <b>PLANET</b> Requirements class, with IRI <tt>/req/planet</tt>, which has a corresponding Conformance Class, <b>PLANET</b>, with IRI <tt>/conf/planet</tt>.</p>
