        <a name="_af52cd34-c107-661a-2cf8-2dbd7ba3a336" id="_af52cd34-c107-661a-2cf8-2dbd7ba3a336"></a>
        <h1 class="Annex"><b>Annex D</b><br/>(informative)<br/><b>Application Examples</b></h1>
