        <div><a name="_c605084b-e836-70da-a9f6-291d2d645a02" id="_c605084b-e836-70da-a9f6-291d2d645a02"></a><h2>D.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Minimum Example</h2>

</div>
        <div><a name="_35bf66b8-5567-5a60-6946-9907fa28668e" id="_35bf66b8-5567-5a60-6946-9907fa28668e"></a><h2>D.2.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Elaborate Example</h2>

