      <div><h1 class="Section3">Bibliography</h1>

<div class="Note"><a name="_fbd336b0-a344-3030-55c6-1975921a4963" id="_fbd336b0-a344-3030-55c6-1975921a4963"></a><p class="Note"><span class="note_label">NOTE:<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span></span>The TC has approved Springer LNCS as the official document citation type. Springer LNCS is widely used in technical and computer science journals and other publications For citations in the text please use square brackets and consecutive numbers: [1], [2], [3] Actual References: [n] Journal: Author Surname, A.: Title. Publication Title. Volume number, Issue number, Pages Used (Year Published)</p></div><p class="Biblio"><a name="iso19142" id="iso19142"></a>[1]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO: ISO&#xA0;19142, <i>Geographic information&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;Web Feature Service</i>. International Organization for Standardization, Geneva <a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/42136.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/42136.html</a>.</p><p class="Biblio"><a name="dcat" id="dcat"></a>[2]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>W3C: <b>Data Catalog Vocabulary,</b> W3C Recommendation 16 January 2014, <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat/">https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat/</a></p><p class="Biblio"><a name="link_relations" id="link_relations"></a>[3]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>IANA: <b>Link Relation Types,</b> <a href="https://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations/link-relations.xml">https://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations/link-relations.xml</a></p><p class="Biblio"><a name="spatial_data_wbp" id="spatial_data_wbp"></a>[4]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>W3C/OGC: <b>Spatial Data on the Web Best Practices,</b> W3C Working Group Note 28 September 2017, <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/sdw-bp/">https://www.w3.org/TR/sdw-bp/</a></p><p class="Biblio"><a name="dwbp" id="dwbp"></a>[5]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>W3C: <b>Data on the Web Best Practices,</b> W3C Recommendation 31 January 2017, <a href="https://